			"notes": "`lava_sharkian` now takes water damage\nPrevents both `lava_torpedo` & `water_torpedo` from being able to launch you upwards\nSlimes now act as a passive-aggressive creature towards `slimeeq` origin\n`pickaxeable` now uses multiplication based damage instead of a set amount\nReworks `tauros's` `grass_graze` ability to now use `on_block_use` instead of eating the block directly under you\nFixes `delicious_kelp` power to work again\n`trashling` can now get bonemeal from custom eating mechanics\n`slimeeq` can feed slimes slime balls to heal them, and make them passive, and even to gain the ability to ride them\nTexture rework of ability bars to make them look more appealing\n`slimeeq` now have a chance to spawn slimes or slime balls when hit\n`tauros` has been nerfed, used to gain 3x attack in the plains, now gains 1.75x attack\nCreate `play_dead` power for axolotls\n{`+makes you invulnerable`, `+entities will not target you`, `+heals you`, `+-plays axolotl death sound`, `-only activates on half a heart`, `-negates ability to see, move, and attack`}"
		},
